% The contract annual return obligation starts: its first obligations.
when the contract annual return obligation starts on day a day with charity a charity
    and the status of the charity is a value
    and the value is equal to active
    and a party is the charity actor of the charity
    and a due day = day + 60
then annual return obligation obliges the party to file annual return by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity.

when the contract annual return obligation starts on day a day with charity a charity
    and the status of the charity is a value
    and the value is different from active
then the contract is fulfilled.

% The contract governor reporting obligation starts: its first obligations.
when the contract governor reporting obligation starts on day a day with governor a governor and matter a matter
    and a party is the governor actor of the governor
    and a due day = day + 14
then governor reporting obligation obliges the party to report reportable matter by day the due day as its first obligation given governor the governor.

% The first obligation of annual return obligation: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does file annual return on day a day
    and annual return obligation obliges the party to file annual return by day a due day as its first obligation given charity a charity
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that annual return obligation obliges the party to file annual return by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity.

when something happens on day a day
    and annual return obligation obliges a party to file annual return by day a due day as its first obligation given charity a charity
    and the day > the due day
then commissioner may issue notice permits commissioner_actor to issue required steps notice as its first obligation given charity the charity
    and it is not the case that annual return obligation obliges the party to file annual return by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity.

% The first obligation of governor reporting obligation: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does report reportable matter with matter a matter on day a day
    and governor reporting obligation obliges the party to report reportable matter by day a due day as its first obligation given governor a governor
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that governor reporting obligation obliges the party to report reportable matter by day the due day as its first obligation given governor the governor.

when something happens on day a day
    and governor reporting obligation obliges a party to report reportable matter by day a due day as its first obligation given governor a governor
    and the day > the due day
then commissioner may suspend permits commissioner_actor to suspend governor with reason "Failed to report reportable matter" as its first obligation
    and it is not the case that governor reporting obligation obliges the party to report reportable matter by day the due day as its first obligation given governor the governor.

% The first obligation of Commissioner may issue notice: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does issue required steps notice on day a day
    and commissioner may issue notice permits the party to issue required steps notice as its first obligation given charity a charity
    and a second party is the charity actor of the charity
    and a due day = day + 30
then charity must comply with notice obliges the second party to file annual return by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity
    and it is not the case that commissioner may issue notice permits the party to issue required steps notice as its first obligation given charity the charity.

% The first obligation of commissioner may suspend: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does suspend governor with reason a reason on day a day
    and commissioner may suspend permits the party to suspend governor with reason the reason as its first obligation
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that commissioner may suspend permits the party to suspend governor with reason the reason as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of charity must comply with notice: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does file annual return on day a day
    and charity must comply with notice obliges the party to file annual return by day a due day as its first obligation given charity a charity
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that charity must comply with notice obliges the party to file annual return by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity.

when something happens on day a day
    and charity must comply with notice obliges a party to file annual return by day a due day as its first obligation given charity a charity
    and the day > the due day
    and a second party is the charity actor of the charity
then the contract is breached by the second party because "Failed to comply with Required Steps Notice"
    and it is not the case that charity must comply with notice obliges the party to file annual return by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity.

